he card, or attached to the card, and checklists can be created to track the tasks or user stories to build the feature.\n\nlinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-536/10-icons-for-ab-test-transforming-0-6-tiles-into-symbols-and-replace \"\u200c\") with sub tickets including loading screen and engineering implementation", "pos": 180223.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 34, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/AOWEFubl/34-testing-tiles-delight-vs-domino-adventure", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:23:21Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 1, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 3, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 1, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/351", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "65ef421f563c27805da46ebb", "name": "Major Bug loading addressable and blocks level 2 end screen,", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca6393", "desc": "", "pos": 3071.9921875, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 35, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/tSKzEZ7k/35-major-bug-loading-addressable-and-blocks-level-2-end-screen", "dateLastActivity": "2024-03-25T17:58:44Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/352", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "65ef7b84f1c2073e9d54932f", "name": "Pulsating ring for tutorial \"click here\" VFX", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca6393", "desc": "[https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-492/tutorial-pulsate-vfx](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-492/tutorial-pulsate-vfx \"smartCard-inline\")", "pos": 442367.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 36, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/kUXaZokB/36-pulsating-ring-for-tutorial-click-here-vfx", "dateLastActivity": "2024-03-25T17:51:39Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/356", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6601bd53420b3639b99a7969", "name": "([PERSON_NAME_24716]) Add Coming Soon for Zone 3 on the chapter selection screen", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4f4e26cfce07d665a38e", "desc": "", "pos": 2639.9932861328125, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 37, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/ZPR7r2Sz/37-person_6065-add-coming-soon-for-zone-3-on-the-chapter-selection-screen", "dateLastActivity": "2024-06-17T17:45:04Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/368", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6614d7e48d16d80c1a20f005", "name": "Move mini-game intro at the end of chapter 1, before starting chapter 2 level 1.", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4f4e26cfce07d665a38e", "desc": "- Couple of issues - Not sure why the group sizes vary starting with 0.1.74 - [\\@Blake](https://harmonygamesgroup.Slack.com/team/U04V95A7C80 \"\u200c\") to look into this issue - the groups should be assigned right away. This reduces my confidence in the test quite a bit\n- We see quite a bit of fluctuation on d7 calendar day performance between 0.1.74 and 0.1.72 across all variants. Not sure what\u2019s causing that.\n- If we trust the test and assumes it works in both 0.1.72 and 0.1.74 as intended (which is questionable), doing a weighted average by sample size makes sense hence the third table called \u201ctotal\u201d added.\n- As I said earlier, Level 12 seems to have highest rolling d1 and calendar day d1. We are losing some d0 playtime due to players likely not getting to the mini-game on d1 but strong d7 playtime makes me feel confident a bit later intro of mini-game is likely not a loss to the overall retention.\n- Level 4 mini-game intro def gives a kick to d0 playtime but that doesn\u2019t translate into stronger d1 24h - interestingly calendar d1 seems more in line with others.\n- Based on what we know from playtest video observations, I think we intro the mini-game at or after level 12. For instance, level 15 could be a good time to unlock them at end of NEW chapter 1, chapter 1 having only 15 levels, which unlocks mini-games). More to discuss with the design team", "pos": 327679.75, "closed": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": [], "idShort": 38, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/Ihi5JGVW/38-move-mini-game-intro-at-the-end-of-chapter-1-before-starting-chapter-2-level-1", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-28T17:31:07Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/370", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66183d50c25a7d886c347a25", "name": "Streak Announcer Sound + Text Effect!", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "Streak announcer and showing texts like \u201cDivine\u201d \u201cDelicious\u201d on the screen when players make matches. There is a separate ticket for Marcus to make streak reward bar filling up in a juicy way. [PERSON_NAME_0040] had an idea on this but I don\u2019t have the details\n\nlinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-552/ui-team-to-create-streak-announcer-text-effects \"\u200c\") for the VFX\n\nlinear Ticket for Sound + Implementation [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-906/sound-for-streak-announcer \"\u200c\")\n\nUsing AI voice for each character\n\nList of text:\n\n1. Brilliant!\n2. Fantastic!\n3. Phenomenal!\n4. Impressive!\n5. Awesome!\n6. Incredible!\n7. Spectacular!\n8. Extraordinary!\n9. Remarkable!\n10. Well Done!", "pos": 540671.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 39, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/976Sbh4d/39-streak-announcer-sound-text-effect", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-31T23:37:22Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 1, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/375", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6624033319305570c484187b", "name": "Memory Game Changes", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "\u200c\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/66241070f87146691776cc59/download/image.png)\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/6624109bb251b2e8e573123c/download/image.png)\n\nEngineering implementation ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-807/implement-new-memory-game-difficulty-selection-and-other-mini-game-ui \"\u200c\") parent ticket is the design and finalizing VFX.", "pos": 311295.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 40, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/hnxgtWoI/40-memory-game-changes", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:25:19Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 2, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 3, "checkItemsChecked": 2, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/376", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6624061a7777adaf9d0c375a", "name": "Level Node Flow Update", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "1. **Automatic Actions**: When a player completes the highest level they have reached in a chapter, the system automatically moves their avatar to the next level and opens the pre-level dialog. This **eliminates** the need for the player to **manually select the level node for new levels**.\n2. **Player Control and Flexibility**: If players do not wish to proceed with the suggested next level, they can close the pre-level dialogue by hitting the X button and choose any previously completed level to replay. This allows for both automated progression and player-directed exploration.\n3. **Replay and Navigation**: To replay a level or navigate to a different one, players can dismiss the pre-level dialog and manually navigate the saga map to select their desired level.\n4. **Efficiency**: This new flow is designed to save players a click (by not requiring them to select a level node for new levels) and to simplify the process of progressing through levels, especially for less experienced players.\n5. **Conditions for Automation**: The auto-move and auto-click features are triggered only upon first completion of a level. For replays, these features do not engage automatically, giving control back to the players to navigate as they please. There is an exception for new sessions. When player starts a new session and returns to the game, we trigger auto-move and auto-click\n\nThis new system seems aimed at enhancing user experience by reducing repetitive tasks and maintaining engagement by swiftly moving players through the game, while still providing options for those who prefer more control over their gameplay.\n\nlinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-805/implement-auto-triggering-for-pre-level-dialogue-for-new-levels \"\u200c\")", "pos": 376831.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 41, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/SXNVDCYm/41-level-node-flow-update", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-29T04:00:52Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 2, "checkItemsChecked": 1, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 2, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/377", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6624066246430e205d7a88b5", "name": "Level Balancing for the first 3 Chapters", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "", "pos": 507903.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 43, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/eqZWZCi7/43-level-balancing-for-the-first-3-chapters", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-29T04:00:47Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/378", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240673997aff10ad0dd707", "name": "Chapter length changes", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "New chapters have the following pacing: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\nThe goal is to divide especially early chapters into smaller chunks such that players will be closer to the \u201cnext thing to Chase\u201d before they are tired out of their sessions.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240673997aff10ad0dd707/attachments/662406c94d146a635da6fba1/download/image.png)\n\n\u200c\n\nlinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-823/change-chapter-length-for-some-earlier-chapters \"\u200c\")", "pos": 573439.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 44, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/JxM7aOIe/44-chapter-length-changes", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:29:39Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 1, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/379", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6624087975d53db7db32f7a8", "name": "Tightening the Character Loop", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "Currently the Hero loop is underoptimized. Player spend very little amount of their playtime upgrading their heros and interacting with them. We also know they are looking for some place to spend their coins on their early journey. I would like to solve these 2 problems together by increasing the number of hero level upgrades from 5 levels to 40 levels. We preserve the bigger ability boosts and use them at level 10, 20, 30, 40.  The in-between levels will increase the amount of coins earned for the 4-streak rewards.  Please see the new structure here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66240952338a6bd2d4e85fcd/download/image.png)\n\nIn addition, we\u2019ll adjust the hero tokens drop rate quite a bit and making hero tokens part of the daily routine.\n\nHere is the new drop table for characters. We need a couple tickets here.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66241338d5f02aa6e36b8198/download/image.png)\n\nTicket for adjusting the drop rates. - Engineering Team\n\nTicket for showing the drop rate on epic level as 2x, and boss level as 3x tokens. (Pre level dialog + Saga map) - UI Team\n\nTicket for making any level drop token for the first try in Chapter 1 after character token tutorial. (Design team locate excel table on token behavior and drop rate)\n\nTicket for updating drop rates after [PERSON_NAME_7904]\u2019s unlock such that level drop [PERSON_NAME_7904] or sophie token.\n\nAnother ticket is needed to update the character screen so that it can accommodate new currency consumption in between levels and show 40 characters somehow (UI tool tip ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-532/need-tooltips-for-character-screens-and-abilities \"\u200c\"))", "pos": 638975.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 45, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/K0pbCCXF/45-tightening-the-character-loop", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-18T21:55:24Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 2, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/380", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "name": "Nathan Tutorial + Character Token as Feature Milestone Preview", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "We need a tutorial showing how to unlock [PERSON_NAME_7904] once the token is received, how you can select Nathan from the pre-level dialogue. We also need to add [PERSON_NAME_7904] as a milestone-preview rewards. We need 2 separate tickets.\n\nSee more detail in FTUE [PERSON_NAME_7904] ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-108/nathan-tutorial \"\u200c\")\n\nBe able to preview when a specific character token will drop using milestone/feature preview system ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-808/figure-out-how-to-preview-character-token-as-milestone-preview \"\u200c\")", "pos": 704511.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 46, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/E9myKTMa/46-nathan-tutorial-character-token-as-feature-milestone-preview", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:29:56Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/381", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918", "name": "End of Level flow update", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918/attachments/66240e60161ff4a988cb47a2/download/image.png)\n\nNeed to implement the new assets, new +5 tile booster that can be only bought with coins at level ends, and new flow. We need ability to \u201ctap here to see the board\u201d functionality. Let\u2019s make our level endings great again\n\nlinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-809/implement-a-new-end-game-flow \"\u200c\") with more details on how this flows.", "pos": 835583.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 48, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/AZtcLBP8/48-end-of-level-flow-update", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:30:13Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 2, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 1, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/382", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240ec36581796efd8b08e4", "name": "Finish implementing other level objectives", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "Roll under the previous PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME ticket of \u201cnew UI update\u201d\n\nMaster ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-625/level-objectives-for-star-ranking \"\u200c\")\n\n4/20/2024: it seems like we are just waiting on engineering implementation along with UI overhaul.", "pos": 999423.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 49, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/kneKyUqk/49-finish-implementing-other-level-objectives", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:31:13Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/383", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240ef342f9dfb4327ca5f5", "name": "([PERSON_NAME_0067]) Integrate Julius and [PERSON_NAME_4102]", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4f4e26cfce07d665a38e", "desc": "We need to build out features for Julius and [PERSON_NAME_4102]\u2019s skill.\n\n[PERSON_NAME_4102] will adopt [PERSON_NAME_1711]\u2019s foresight ability, with the ability to match foresighted tiles off the board.\n\nJulius will have a brand new ability that removes tiles from the board while adding gold tiles.\n\n[PERSON_NAME_4102] [TICKET](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-1052/lexi-character-and-ability-implementation \"\u200c\")\n\n[PERSON_NAME_7900] [TICKET](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-1051/julius-character-and-ability-implementation \"\u200c\")\n\nCharacter Abilities [TICKET](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-1053/implement-character-level-abilities-and-parameters \"\u200c\")", "pos": 2879.99267578125, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 50, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/MmmeXrc9/50-owen.baker-integrate-julius-and-lexi", "dateLastActivity": "2024-07-10T21:43:52Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 1, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 2, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/384", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1", "name": "Update in-level UI", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1/attachments/66240fb5422ef2ef36a6408b/download/image.png)\n\nWheel menu was a bust. We disabled wheel menu already. We need to change the UI again to accomondate boosters at the bottom.\n\nWe also need a new tutorial for how to use the bomb booster.\n\nlinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-788/new-core-game-ui \"\u200c\")", "pos": 966655.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 51, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/DkBC6fea/51-update-in-level-ui", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:30:45Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 1, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/385", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "6624104e91f7f3eb4fa1ebea", "name": "Mini-game hub accessiblity", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "desc": "The related linear ticket is [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-540/need-visual-elements-to-lock-the-memory-game-until-its-unlocked-also \"\u200c\")\n\nThe goal is to make the mini games more visually prominent so players know they are clickable.", "pos": 1032191.75, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 52, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/sHI2p1YK/52-mini-game-hub-accessiblity", "dateLastActivity": "2024-05-17T16:31:33Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/386", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "662411071cc91794db394686", "name": "([PERSON_NAME_0050] / [USERNAME_32910]) Tablets UI and VFX compatibility", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4f56f3326b4787f64aa2", "desc": "[PERSON_NAME_0050] to come up with test plan each time we make new VFX/UI change and the various aspect ratio we need to try to make sure it still works.\n\nSome example list of aspect ratios:\n\n- iPad Mini 1.523 : 1\n- Old iPads 4:3\n- Widescreen Android tablets 16:9\n- Folding Phones 1:1\n- Standard phone 20:9\n- iPhone 15 is 19.5:9\n\n[https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-839/different-layout-bugs-all-game-screens-should-be-layout-proof-and](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/i[USERNAME_27871]/ENG-839/different-layout-bugs-all-game-screens-should-be-layout-proof-and \"smartCard-inline\")\n\nDeprecated OG Text issue linear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-780/handle-tablet-text-more-gracefully \"\u200c\")", "pos": 349951.7578125, "closed": false, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6408"], "idShort": 53, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/cmyokyHv/53-vincent.parker-kam-tablets-ui-and-vfx-compatibility", "dateLastActivity": "2024-10-10T23:08:14Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "