ull, "badges": {"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/449", "field": "idBoard", "value": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "record": {"id": "666f1d7b77cd1c78c4b82df5", "name": "Make mini-games accessible via saga map nodes", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idList": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca6390", "desc": "1. **Node Placement:**\n   - Mini-game nodes are placed on the saga map every 10 levels. These nodes visually differ from regular level nodes to make them easily identifiable.\n   - The mini-game nodes are integrated into the natural progression flow of the saga map.\n2. **Skippable Option:**\n   - Players have the option to skip the mini-game nodes if they choose, allowing them to continue their regular progression without interruption.\n   - A clear \"skip\" button is provided, making it easy for players to bypass the mini-game if they prefer.\n3. **Pre-Level Dialogue:**\n   - Upon reaching a mini-game node, a pre-level dialogue appears. This dialogue introduces the mini-game, explains the objectives, and outlines the rewards.\n   - The pre-level dialogue also includes a \"skip\" button for players who do not wish to play the mini-game.\n4. **Incentives and Rewards:**\n   - Strong incentives are offered to encourage players to participate in the mini-games. Rewards may include stars, gems, or other in-game currencies. For instance -  River Tile: Level 1 - Reach Score 20, Rewards: 1 Star, 50 Gems etc.\n     Level 2 - Reach Score 25, Rewards: 1 Start, 50 gems\n   - Each mini-game can have different levels of difficulty with corresponding rewards. For example, achieving a certain score in the mini-game can grant players stars or gems.\n5. **Progression and Objectives:**\n   - Mini-games may have specific goals or challenges, such as reaching a particular score or completing a task within a time limit.\n   - Progression in mini-games can be tracked, and players can earn stars or other rewards based on their performance.\n6. **Accessibility and Awareness:**\n   - A clean list of mini-games is available within the mini-game hub for easy access. This list ensures players can find and play mini-games even outside the saga map.\n   - Notifications or visual cues (e.g., a red dot) may be used to alert players to the presence of a mini-game node.\n7. **Integration with Main Game:**\n   - Mini-games are designed to be part of the main game flow, providing a natural break in the regular gameplay and offering variety.\n   - The completion of mini-games can contribute to the player's overall progression in the game, adding an extra layer of engagement.\n\nBy incorporating these mechanics, mini-games on the saga map provide an engaging and rewarding experience that seamlessly integrates with the player's journey through the main game.", "pos": 475135.75, "closed": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "idMembers": [], "idLabels": [], "idShort": 100, "shortLink": null, "shortUrl": null, "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/eb9tjpS4/100-make-mini-games-accessible-via-saga-map-nodes", "dateLastActivity": "2024-10-11T22:22:54Z", "cover": null, "badges": {"attachments": 1, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/cards/460", "field": "idBoard", "val